---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About QRNLab — history, mission, and location">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">About</h1>

  <section class="mt-8">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight border-b border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700 pb-2">Overview</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
      QRNLab is a multidisciplinary research group dedicated to advancing fundamental and applied physics. Our work spans a wide spectrum of domains, from nuclear and medical physics to quantum computing and astrophysics. The lab operates under the guidance of Dr. Quazi Muhammad Rashed Nizam, whose expertise in nuclear physics forms the foundation of our experimental and theoretical investigations.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
      Our aim is to foster collaboration among students and researchers passionate about exploring the intersection of classical and quantum domains, driving innovation across physics disciplines.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight border-b border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700 pb-2">Motivation</h2>
    <ol class="mt-4 list-inside list-decimal space-y-2 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 max-w-3xl">
      <li>To find out the hidden laws of the universe by investigating the nucleus.</li>
      <li>To offer a helping hand to students.</li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight border-b border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700 pb-2">Location</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed">
      Department of Physics, University of Chittagong<br />
      Chittagong, 4331, Bangladesh.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
